  Note: the curried select_3 above uses asymmetric-binary dist_l around
  o_n_plusmap. The trailing Unitary2qBox gates implement tag-bit
  rearrangement between the binary (I + (I+I)) encoding and the flat
  n-ary encoding used by meta control. The two circuits are semantically
  equivalent up to a tag permutation.

